urname><given-names>GD</given-names></name><name><surname>Muhammed</surname><given-names>I</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Burns in children under 3 years of age: the Zaria experience</article-title><source>Annals of Tropical Paediatrics</source><year>1996</year><volume>16</volume><fpage>243</fpage><lpage>8</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8893955</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B11"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Moshiro</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Ivar</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Anne</surname><given-names>N&#x001fa;</given-names></name><name><surname>Philip</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Yusuf</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Gunnar</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Injury morbidity in an urban and a rural area in Tanzania: an epidemiological survey</article-title><source>BMC Public Health</source><year>2005</year><volume>5</volume><fpage>11</fpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15679887</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1186/1471-2458-5-11</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>